# makepkg build artifacts -- generated when running `makepkg` locally on
# this PKGBUILD directly (e.g. to install on the current machine, or as a
# quick smoke test before pushing changes). The ISO builder runs makepkg
# inside an isolated container and never touches this directory, so these
# files only appear during out-of-tree local builds and must never be
# committed.
src/
pkg/
*.pkg.tar.zst
*.pkg.tar.xz
*.log
